# Use ALL helpers + ALL rules — NO EXCEPTIONS

**User rule (locked Aug 19 2026):** **No exceptions. Do not be lazy.** Utilize **every** helper and **every applicable Cursor rule** every time — session start, restart, compaction, and **before repo-touching work on every turn**.

Skipping any helper or rule is a **regression**.

## HARD STOP

**Do not** call Read, Grep, Glob, Shell (on repo), or edit until the applicable checklist is **complete**. No carve-outs for quick fixes, simple questions, or “already know.”

## Checklist A — every new session, restart, or context compaction (all steps, in order)

- [ ] **1. Continuity verify** — `bash scripts/verify-agent-continuity.sh --all-repos`
- [ ] **2. Entry routers** — `AGENTS.md` → `CLAUDE.md` → `CURSOR.md`
- [ ] **3. RepoResident** — `.agent/STATE.md`; `MAP.md` / `DECISIONS.md` when routing
- [ ] **4. cursor-memory-bank** — `memory-bank/activeContext.md` + `progress.md`
- [ ] **5. MindLink** — `.brain/MEMORY.md` (Core + User Profile), `.brain/SESSION.md`, `.brain/LOG.md` last 5, `.brain/SHARED.md`
- [ ] **6. SessionMem** — MCP `retrieveMemories`; fallback `memory-bank/sessionmem-seeds.md`
- [ ] **7. Cursor rules** — **Read every** `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` with `alwaysApply: true` (index: `memory-bank/cursor-rules-always-apply-index.md`); on DGX also Read `~/.cursor/rules/*.mdc` with `alwaysApply: true`. **Read the files — do not skip because an index exists.**
- [ ] **8. Graphify** — `graphify query "<task question>"` before Read/Grep/Glob

**Authority:** RepoResident `.agent/STATE.md` outranks `memory-bank/activeContext.md`.

## Checklist B — every turn before repo-touching tools

- [ ] **SessionMem** — `retrieveMemories` (every turn)
- [ ] **Graphify** — `graphify query` (every turn)
- [ ] **Cursor rules** — Read any `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` whose `globs` match files you will touch; re-read alwaysApply rules if unsure
- [ ] **RepoResident + memory-bank + MindLink** — re-read `STATE.md` + `activeContext.md` + `SESSION.md` if task area changed or after compaction

After code edits: `graphify update . --no-cluster`.

## Helpers — utilization (ongoing, no laziness)

| Helper | Requirement |
|--------|-------------|
| **RepoResident** | STATE every session; workflows; update STATE at end |
| **cursor-memory-bank** | activeContext every session; protected-state before locked features |
